/*

Parties for the debug menu.

The trainer description for DEBUG_TRAINER_PLAYER is not used,
its party is given to the player whenever the Set Party action is selected,
or the Start Debug Battle action is selected.

The debug menu will start a battle against DEBUG_TRAINER_AI when the
Start Debug Battle action is selected.

Orchid: this is a showcase battle for battle animations and backgrounds. Between them
the parties cover physical and special attacks from both sides, status moves
(burn, paralysis, sleep, poison), stat changes, weather, a screen-shake move
(Earthquake), a scanline-effect move (Surf), and an opponent at a lower level so faints and forced switches
happen within a few turns.

*/

